1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,653 --> 00:00:23,760
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,680
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,872
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,482 --> 00:00:34,680
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:37,560
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:41,157
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,604 --> 00:00:44,357
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,023 --> 00:00:50,628
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,628 --> 00:00:54,277
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,210 --> 00:01:00,840
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,243 --> 00:01:05,000
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,317 --> 00:01:08,177
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,769 --> 00:01:14,589
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:21,000
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 4=

17
00:01:31,089 --> 00:01:33,440
(Xilele Steamed Buns)

18
00:01:48,586 --> 00:01:49,840
(Xilele Steamed Buns)

19
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,120
What a jerk.

20
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,160
Who is that guy?

21
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,920
What does he want?

22
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,920
Please, could you...

23
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,040
Keep it down! It's late.

24
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:11,600
Okay.

25
00:02:19,131 --> 00:02:21,120
(Xilele Steamed Buns)

26
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:21,960
Want a snack?

27
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:26,760
Get lost!

28
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,360
Old geezer.

29
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,840
Light sleeper.

30
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,400
So fussy.

31
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,760
You weren't even that loud.

32
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,160
My fault.

33
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,160
It's all my fault.

34
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,760
It's all my bad.

35
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,320
But no matter how much you hate me,

36
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,440
I'll save you.

37
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,080
You've got to be kidding.

38
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:57,280
Save me? Am I going to die?

39
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:57,760
Yes.

40
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:01,720
I'm sorry.

41
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,920
I went about this all wrong.

42
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,000
I talked to you like I knew best,

43
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,560
using what I knew about the future.

44
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:09,920
Am I really going to die?

45
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,800
Why are you so serious?

46
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,720
You will.

47
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,480
I'd be heartbroken.

48
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,080
So?

49
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,200
I can save you.

50
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,920
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

51
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,640
I can't tell you why yet.

52
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:34,960
But for that to happen,

53
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,840
you have to fall for me.

54
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,920
I know that won't happen overnight.

55
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,640
Not with more time, either.

56
00:03:39,883 --> 00:03:44,680
♪Every breath feels like I'm stealing♪

57
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,200
Then do one last thing for me.

58
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,280
If you agree,

59
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,440
I promise I'll disappear.

60
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,400
What is it?

61
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:51,920
Come to the hospital with me.

62
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,560
Get a full,

63
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,680
proper checkup.

64
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,840
I need to know you're healthy.

65
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,760
Once I get the results,

66
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:58,320
I promise,

67
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,520
from then on,

68
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,640
I'll stay out of your life.

69
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,440
For good.

70
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:01,960
Wait.

71
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,360
That's such a weird thing to ask.

72
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:10,560
But if it stops you pestering me,

73
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,120
that actually

74
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,760
sounds pretty good.

75
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,600
♪Just like that, it turns to rain♪

76
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,880
Do I have to pay for the checkup?

77
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,600
I'll pay.

78
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,320
Let me think about it.

79
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,480
What's there to think about?

80
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,440
We've known each other for ages.

81
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,360
Not even a week!

82
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:29,316
♪We live in the spaces between moments♪

83
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,040
I've never lied to you.

84
00:04:31,093 --> 00:04:34,266
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

85
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:34,760
Fine.

86
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:36,960
I'll do it.

87
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,600
But I expect you

88
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:39,880
to keep your word.

89
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:42,720
♪Let's not speak of what's to come
or what came before♪

90
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,360
I'll walk you home.

91
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,120
You'd do that even if I said no.

92
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,120
- Creep.
- Yep.

93
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,360
Keep your distance.

94
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:55,720
I don't like talking to weirdos

95
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,920
or people I barely know.

96
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,080
Seeing you is enough.

97
00:04:59,080 --> 00:04:59,960
How do I put this?

98
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:02,120
You seem so familiar,

99
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,880
but you're also so annoying.

100
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,120
Good thing you haven't moved.

101
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,120
Or I'd have no idea where to find you.

102
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,160
It's like

103
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,200
you know everything,

104
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,880
but can't explain any of it.

105
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:20,400
Either you're hiding a huge secret,

106
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,240
or...

107
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,920
As they say online,

108
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,080
our IQs are so far apart

109
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,840
we can't understand each other.

110
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:27,480
Definitely the first one.

111
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,160
You're not a bad guy.

112
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,240
You figured that out fast.

113
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:32,920
Bye.

114
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,160
What's your name again?

115
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,240
You're asking my name.

116
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,720
Does that mean you hate me less?

117
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,000
I'm asking you here.

118
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,800
Is that relevant to my answer?

119
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:49,920
My name is...

120
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,680
Zhang Yongsen?

121
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:52,880
Who's this?

122
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,240
Uncle?

123
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,040
Dad?

124
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,000
So this is Yongsen.

125
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,920
No wonder he's so rude.

126
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:03,160
Wait.

127
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,920
Aren't you Lin Duo's mom?

128
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:09,560
Yongsen,

129
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,120
thanks for telling me.

130
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,800
Your aunt has been waiting for me.

131
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:16,360
Love really does take courage.

132
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,760
(Go see Auntie when you can.)

133
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,360
(She's been waiting for you.)

134
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,640
You're...

135
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,600
Yongsen?

136
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,840
How is everyone related here?

137
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:45,800
(Yongsen,)

138
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,720
(be nice to him when you meet.)

139
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:48,320
(Okay.)

140
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,080
Duo,

141
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,000
your mom and I are getting divorced.

142
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,800
But I still love you.

143
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,080
I love you so, so much.

144
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,120
Okay?

145
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,440
Duo, let's go.

146
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:11,960
Bye, Dad.

147
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:17,680
Come on.

148
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,680
Mr. Lin, we're here.

149
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,760
Could you come out?

150
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:27,680
Mr. Lin?

151
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,000
We're here. Could you come out?

152
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,200
Mr. Lin?

153
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:37,640
Dad...

154
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,400
Dad and Mom went to explore the moon.

155
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,200
The lady said

156
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,480
you could take me to the moon.

157
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,640
Let me think about it.

158
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,160
When you're ready, if you agree,

159
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,400
please sign the adoption papers,
Mr. Lin.

160
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:57,480
(Adoption Agreement)

161
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:12,640
(Remember,)

162
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,680
(the stronger your consciousness,)

163
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,360
(the longer you last in other worlds.)

164
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,000
(If your consciousness)

165
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:20,680
(gets swallowed up by another world,)

166
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,360
(you'll cease to exist.)

167
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,800
So you do have a huge secret.

168
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:37,760
Explain yourself.

169
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:40,720
Don't be nervous.

170
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,360
We're all family here.

171
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:43,440
Go on.

172
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,120
First, do you believe in
parallel universes?

173
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,240
I'm no ordinary guy.

174
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,360
You've seen Doraemon, right?

175
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,880
Open a drawer, and boom!

176
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:03,760
Here I am.

177
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,400
Shut it, and poof! I'm gone.

178
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,800
I think that was pretty clear.

179
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,200
Un...

180
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,520
Uncle.

181
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,120
Look, Duo's thinking.

182
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:25,560
I think she gets it.

183
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,440
Let her talk.

184
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,000
He's Zhang Yongsen.

185
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,120
He's from a parallel universe.

186
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,600
You crossed over here!

187
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,960
Bingo!

188
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:54,160
Do you mean what you said earlier?

189
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:56,840
I...

190
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,120
What was I saying again?

191
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,640
You said

192
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:04,120
you'd take me for a checkup,

193
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,240
then leave me alone.

194
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:07,760
Then do one last thing for me.

195
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,440
If you agree,

196
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,480
I promise I'll disappear.

197
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,560
What is it?

198
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,040
Come to the hospital with me.

199
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,440
Okay.

200
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,200
I'll do it.

201
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:24,000
It's a really weird request,

202
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:26,080
but it beats you pestering me.

203
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,280
Exactly.

204
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,240
I can't say it.

205
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,000
And no one can know.

206
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,840
Jiang Cheng said

207
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,200
every imagined scenario

208
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,920
creates a new parallel universe.

209
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:54,720
If...

210
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,080
one day, I suddenly disappeared...

211
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,800
Disappeared? Who said you could?

212
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,440
And someone else

213
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,480
who looked exactly like me showed up,

214
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:06,240
but my mind wasn't in her head...

215
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,080
Would you still love me?

216
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,160
Oh, please.

217
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,040
You're always imagining nonsense.

218
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,360
It's just for fun.

219
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,280
I've even imagined

220
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,200
we were long-lost siblings.

221
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,440
You've watched too many vertical dramas.

222
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,400
Honey, I miss you.

223
00:11:30,836 --> 00:11:32,517
(No. 3 People's Hospital
Outpatient Building)

224
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,920
Ma'am, let me help you inside.

225
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:46,600
Okay.

226
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:47,680
Thank you.

227
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,440
Hello.

228
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:54,920
Mr. Zhang booked

229
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:57,000
our VIP checkup package for you.

230
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,640
It costs a fortune.

231
00:11:59,080 --> 00:11:59,560
Doctor!

232
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,520
Help me!

233
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,200
I...

234
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,440
I can't breathe.

235
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,440
Sir, are you okay?

236
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,240
- I can't breathe.
- See him first.

237
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:07,960
How do you feel?

238
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:08,320
I'm fine.

239
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:08,800
Okay.

240
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:09,560
Take your time.

241
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:11,280
See Dr. Gao on the third floor.

242
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:12,240
Sir?

243
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,040
He says he can't breathe.

244
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:14,960
Sir, lift your head.

245
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,760
Let me check on him.

246
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:16,520
Sir?

247
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:18,000
Sir?

248
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:19,560
Sir!

249
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:21,800
Get a doctor!

250
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:22,520
On it!

251
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,400
Get a doctor! Hurry!

252
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:24,520
Doctor!

253
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,000
Sir!

254
00:12:25,530 --> 00:12:28,560
(Lin Duo, M, 22Y, IMA 1/1 R)

255
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,920
What took you so long to get here?

256
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,880
Dr. Gao, what's going on?

257
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,720
Is it serious?

258
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,960
Should we talk about this privately?
Outside?

259
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,840
No, you've got it wrong.

260
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,680
I just meant you got here late.

261
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,680
My shift's almost over.

262
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,520
You scared me!

263
00:12:51,520 --> 00:12:52,680
You scared me, too.

264
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:55,000
You both scared me.

265
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:05,200
Dr. Gao,

266
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
for my checkup,

267
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:09,120
do I really need all these tests?

268
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:12,160
Your husband wanted a full checkup,

269
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,480
so he had every test

270
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:14,240
added to the bill.

271
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:15,240
So far,

272
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,120
your lung CT scan

273
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:16,840
looks normal.

274
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,560
I'll check your blood count
when it's back.

275
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,040
I don't have a husband.

276
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:22,520
Don't jinx me!

277
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,320
Stop talking nonsense.

278
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:24,840
Let's go.

279
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,160
Thank you.

280
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:32,880
Dr. Gao!

281
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:34,840
We've got a big problem.

282
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,120
This is a patient's CT scan.

283
00:13:39,562 --> 00:13:40,640
(Lin Duo, M, 22Y, IMA 1/1 R)

284
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:49,120
Coming through! Move aside!

285
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:49,840
- Make way!
- Move!

286
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:50,840
Please make way!

287
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,040
Make way up ahead!

288
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,880
Did something happen?

289
00:13:59,240 --> 00:13:59,920
Obviously.

290
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,480
Why else would they be at a hospital?

291
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:02,680
I mean...

292
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:03,560
I know what you're going to say.

293
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:04,760
Don't worry.

294
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:07,440
I only care about your test results.

295
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,760
Once they're in...

296
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,360
If there's nothing wrong,

297
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:16,200
I'll stay far away.

298
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,280
Smart choice.

299
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,840
There's an outbreak in the city.

300
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,120
It's highly contagious.

301
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,480
Please wear a mask when you go out

302
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,400
and avoid contact.

303
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:51,600
What's the date?

304
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:53,680
Don't you have a phone?

305
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:00,320
Oh no.

306
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:03,240
Make way! Make way!

307
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,400
Move!

308
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,560
Everyone, move!

309
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:07,480
Come on!

310
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,640
- Help him!
- Doctor!

311
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:10,000
Doctor!

312
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:11,280
(Stop)
Help him!

313
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:12,560
- You okay?
- Doctor!

314
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,660
- Duo!
- Check on him, now.

315
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:14,840
Lin Duo!

316
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:15,760
Sir, this is a hospital.

317
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:17,160
Let me in!

318
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:18,200
Duo's in danger!

319
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,760
I'm from 100 years in the future!

320
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,200
I have to save my wife!

321
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,000
You can't go in!

322
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:28,000
Lin Duo!

323
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,200
Masks.

324
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:35,760
Masks!

325
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:38,520
Where are the masks?

326
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:39,880
Any masks in this hospital?

327
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,160
Duo, let's go.

328
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,120
It's not safe here.

329
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,000
Come on.

330
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:47,960
Dr. Gao!

331
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:48,640
What are you doing?

332
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:52,280
We've got a big problem.

333
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,560
Why are you always so jumpy?

334
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,080
You said

335
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,640
if I got checked out

336
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:06,040
and was fine, you'd leave me alone.

337
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,400
Changed your mind?

338
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,080
A lot of people are going to die.

339
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:17,800
Yeah, there's something wrong with me.

340
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,480
I was crazy to believe your promises.

341
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,600
I can't explain it!

342
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,680
Every time I explain,

343
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,560
time rewinds!

344
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,480
We've been right here

345
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,720
nine times!

346
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:34,840
Duo, trust me.

347
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,240
I've never lied to you.

348
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,000
Zhen!

349
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:39,040
I've never lied to you, either!

350
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:41,280
We were just talking
about work at the hotel!

351
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,240
Really!

352
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:49,280
Does it hurt?

353
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:51,280
Does it hurt?

354
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,720
I'm telling the truth.

355
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,840
I believe him.

356
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,960
Why won't you believe me?

357
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:09,920
Everything I said is true.

358
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:14,720
I feel like I believe you,

359
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,760
but I can't quite accept it.

360
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:18,760
I...

361
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,080
- Make way!
- Move!

362
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:20,760
Make way!

363
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,360
Move!

364
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:21,960
Make way!

365
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:22,720
(Emergency alert.)

366
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,000
(Level One hospital lockdown.)

367
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:25,440
(Activate the highest-level)

368
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,880
(biohazard emergency protocol.)

369
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:28,560
(Everyone, isolate immediately.)

370
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:30,440
(No physical contact,)

371
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:31,520
(movement or talking.)

372
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:32,400
(I repeat:)

373
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:34,280
(Level One lockdown. Isolate in place.)

374
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,120
Hurry! Move!

375
00:17:45,450 --> 00:17:48,980
♪Does fate write every hello♪

376
00:17:49,010 --> 00:17:50,990
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

377
00:17:56,930 --> 00:18:00,410
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

378
00:18:00,530 --> 00:18:02,460
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

379
00:18:08,510 --> 00:18:13,250
♪I remember the way you breathe♪

380
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:17,300
♪Countless versions of me♪

381
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:23,700
♪All point in the same direction♪

382
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:27,260
♪Toward you♪

383
00:18:29,430 --> 00:18:31,060
♪I'll find you♪

384
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:34,340
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

385
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:36,720
♪I'll find you♪

386
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:39,940
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

387
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,260
♪I'll find you♪

388
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:45,660
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

389
00:18:46,270 --> 00:18:48,030
♪I'll find you♪

390
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,060
♪I'll find you♪

391
00:18:54,180 --> 00:18:57,220
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

392
00:18:57,670 --> 00:18:59,270
♪I'll find you♪

393
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:02,580
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

394
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:05,220
♪I'll find you♪

395
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:08,500
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

396
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,910
♪I'll find you♪

397
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:20,180
♪I'll find you♪
